---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Chi siamo" description="Formiche d'Italia nasce dalla tesi FormiKey. Scopri il progetto, il team e le fonti dei dati.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-forest-50 via-white to-brand-50">
    <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-forest-100/40 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24 relative">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-forest-900 tracking-tight" data-i18n="about_title">Chi siamo</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about_hero_desc">
        <strong class="text-forest-800">Formiche d'Italia</strong> nasce come evoluzione digitale della tesi FormiKey,
        un progetto di ricerca dedicato all'identificazione delle formiche italiane.
        L'obiettivo: rendere la mirmecologia accessibile a tutti.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FormiKey -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600" data-i18n="about_origin_label">Le origini</span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-2" data-i18n="about_formikey_title">Cos'è FormiKey?</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about_formikey_p1">
            FormiKey nasce dalla tesi di laurea magistrale
            <em>"Chiave interattiva per il riconoscimento dei generi di Formicidae italiani
            e delle specie della città di Roma"</em>, discussa da Francesco Simone Mensa
            nell'anno accademico 2016-2017 presso il Dipartimento di Scienze
            dell'Università Roma Tre, Corso di Laurea in Biodiversità e Gestione degli Ecosistemi,
            sotto la supervisione del Prof. Andrea Di Giulio.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about_formikey_p2">
            La tesi ha prodotto una chiave interattiva multi-accesso basata su matrici
            di caratteri morfologici costruite con il software Mesquite e la piattaforma MOSCHweb.
            A differenza delle chiavi dicotomiche tradizionali, FormiKey permette di selezionare
            i caratteri in qualsiasi ordine. Le matrici originali sono state successivamente
            validate dal Dr. Fabrizio Rigato (Museo Civico di Storia Naturale di Milano).
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about_formikey_p3">
            La tesi copre i 41 generi e 7 sottofamiglie presenti nella penisola italiana,
            con un approfondimento sulle 75 specie della città di Roma, che rappresentano
            il 30% delle specie italiane. Il sito Formiche d'Italia è l'evoluzione digitale
            di questo lavoro di ricerca.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://www.researchgate.net/publication/330994606_Chiave_interattiva_per_il_riconoscimento_dei_generi_di_Formicidae_italiani_e_delle_specie_della_citta_di_Roma"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-4 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-forest-100 text-forest-700 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-forest-200 transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" /></svg>
            <span data-i18n="about_thesis_link">Leggi la tesi su ResearchGate</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-2">
          <div class="bg-forest-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-forest-100">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-forest-800 mb-3" data-i18n="about_formikey_numbers">FormiKey in numeri</h3>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-600" data-i18n="about_stat_subfamilies">Sottofamiglie</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-forest-700">7</span>
              </div>
              <div class="h-px bg-forest-200"></div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-600" data-i18n="about_stat_genera">Generi</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-forest-700">39</span>
              </div>
              <div class="h-px bg-forest-200"></div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-600" data-i18n="about_stat_species">Specie</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-forest-700">75</span>
              </div>
              <div class="h-px bg-forest-200"></div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-600" data-i18n="about_stat_characters">Caratteri morfologici</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-forest-700">40</span>
              </div>
              <div class="h-px bg-forest-200"></div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-600" data-i18n="about_stat_photos">Foto specimen</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-forest-700">342+</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Il progetto -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-forest-600" data-i18n="about_platform_label">La piattaforma</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-2 mb-8" data-i18n="about_platform_title">Tre strumenti in un'unica piattaforma</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <a href="/identifica" class="group bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-200 hover:border-forest-400 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-forest-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-forest-200 transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-forest-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-forest-600 transition-colors" data-i18n="home_card_identify_title">Identifica</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1" data-i18n="about_tool_identify">Chiave interattiva multi-accesso con tolleranza errori</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/generi" class="group bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-200 hover:border-forest-400 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-brand-200 transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-forest-600 transition-colors" data-i18n="home_card_browse_title">Esplora</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1" data-i18n="about_tool_browse">39 generi e 75 specie con foto specimen AntWeb</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/esperti" class="group bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-200 hover:border-brand-400 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors" data-i18n="home_card_experts_title">Esperti</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1" data-i18n="about_tool_experts">Rete di mirmecologi italiani con profilo accademico</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Il team -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-forest-600" data-i18n="about_team_label">Il team</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-2 mb-10" data-i18n="about_team_title">Chi c'è dietro al progetto</h2>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
            <img src="/images/esperti/francesco-mensa.jpg" alt="Francesco Simone Mensa" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full object-cover" />
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg">Francesco Simone Mensa</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-forest-600" data-i18n="about_role_creator">Creatore del progetto</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about_bio_francesco">
            Autore della chiave FormiKey e dei dati tassonomici.
            Ha progettato le matrici di caratteri morfologici e curato
            la raccolta dei dati su generi e specie italiane.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
            <img src="/images/claude-logo.svg" alt="Claude by Anthropic" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full" />
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-lg">Claude <span class="text-gray-400 font-normal text-sm">(Anthropic)</span></h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-brand-600" data-i18n="about_role_dev">Sviluppo tecnico</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about_bio_claude">
            Sviluppo del sito web, della piattaforma e della chiave di identificazione interattiva.
            Implementazione del sistema di scoring con tolleranza agli errori e information gain.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Ringraziamenti -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600" data-i18n="about_thanks_label">Ringraziamenti</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-2 mb-6" data-i18n="about_thanks_title">Collaboratori e supporto</h2>
      <div class="bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-brand-100">
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about_thanks_text">
          Si ringrazia il <strong>Dr. Fabrizio Rigato</strong> (Museo Civico di Storia Naturale di Milano)
          per la validazione delle matrici morfologiche, e tutti i mirmecologi italiani che
          hanno contribuito alla conoscenza della fauna formicologica italiana.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Fonti dei dati -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-forest-600" data-i18n="about_sources_label">Fonti</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-2 mb-8" data-i18n="about_sources_title">Da dove vengono i dati</h2>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-forest-100 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-forest-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900" data-i18n="about_source_formikey">Matrici FormiKey</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500" data-i18n="about_source_formikey_desc">Dati originali dalla tesi di ricerca</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-100 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2" /></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900" data-i18n="about_source_schifani">Schifani 2022</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500" data-i18n="about_source_schifani_desc">Checklist Formicidae d'Italia</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">AntWeb.org</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500" data-i18n="about_source_antweb_desc">Immagini specimen (CC BY-SA 3.0)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-forest-100 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-forest-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" /></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">OpenAlex API</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500" data-i18n="about_source_openalex_desc">Dati bibliometrici e profili accademici</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contribuisci CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-forest-600 to-forest-800">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white" data-i18n="about_cta_title">Vuoi contribuire?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-forest-100 text-lg leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about_cta_desc">
        Formiche d'Italia è un progetto in crescita. Se sei un esperto di formiche italiane
        e vuoi contribuire, rivendica il tuo profilo o contattaci per proporre correzioni.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/esperti" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white text-forest-700 font-semibold hover:bg-forest-50 transition-colors" data-i18n="about_cta_experts">
          Directory esperti
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:formicheditalia@gmail.com?subject=Contributo%20a%20Formiche%20d'Italia" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-white/30 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors" data-i18n="about_cta_contact">
          Contattaci
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
